{"resourceIdentifier":"5264","resourceName":"Yunfu LFG Power Generation Project","description":"Yunfu LFG Power Generation Project (hereinafter referred to as the project) locates at Ma Ji pit MSW sanitary landfill, Bahe Village, Hekou Street, Yuncheng District, Yunfu City, Gangdong Province, P.R China. The project is owned and implemented by Yunfu Shangning New energy Technology Co., LTD (hereinafter called the project owner).The project started construction in May 2022 and operated on 17-Dec-2022. The annual output of electricity is estimated to 11,520 MWh. Some of the electricity is for self-use and the rest will be fed into grid. The project is expected to achieve an annual emission reduction of 64,225 tCO2e and a total emission reduction of 270,624 tCO2e during the fixed 10-year crediting period.","location":{"latitude":23.010432,"longitude":112.102373},"inPublicCommentPeriod":false,"lastPublicCommentPeriod":{"startInclusive":"2024-10-08","endExclusive":"2024-11-08","endInclusive":"2024-11-07"},"attributes":[{"code":"PROJECT_ID","values":[{"type":"string","value":"5264"}]},{"code":"STATE_PROVINCE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Guangdong"}]}],"participationSummaries":[{"programCode":"VCS","attributes":[{"code":"PROPONENT_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Multiple Proponents"}]},{"code":"PROJECT_STATUS","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Registered"}]},{"code":"EST_ANNUAL_EMISSION_REDCT","values":[{"type":"string","value":"47759"}]},{"code":"PRIMARY_PROJECT_CATEGORY_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"Energy industries (renewable/non-renewable sources)"}]},{"code":"PROTOCOL_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"ACM0001"}]},{"code":"VALIDATOR_NAME","values":[{"type":"string","value":"CTI Certification Co., Ltd."}]},{"code":"PROJECT_REGISTRATION_DATE","values":[{"type":"string","value":"07/04/2025"}]},{"code":"CREDIT_PERIOD_INFO","values":[{"type":"string","value":"1st, 17/12/2022 - 16/12/2032"}]}]}],"documentGroups":[{"code":"VCS_PIPELINE_